---
// Nhóm nút chọn một (radio) dạng segmented — thuần CSS; trang/CSS đọc trạng thái qua :has(#id:checked).
interface Option {
  id: string;
  label: string;
}
interface Props {
  name: string;
  label: string;
  options: Option[];
  checked: string; // id mặc định
}
const { name, label, options, checked } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="flex items-center gap-3" role="radiogroup" aria-label={label}>
  <span>{label}:</span>
  <div class="inline-flex overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-line">
    {
      options.map((o) => (
        <label class="cursor-pointer px-3 py-1 has-checked:bg-primary has-checked:text-surface has-focus-visible:outline-2 has-focus-visible:outline-primary">
          <input type="radio" name={name} id={o.id} class="sr-only" checked={o.id === checked} />
          {o.label}
        </label>
      ))
    }
  </div>
</div>
